# Large regenerable geospatial rasters - GitHub hard-blocks files over
# 100MB. Regenerate with:
#   python scripts/15_fetch_dem.py
#   python scripts/23_fetch_landcover.py
# See README.md "Fetching the DEM and land-cover rasters" for details.
gis/KP_DEM.tif
gis/KP_DEM.tif.aux.xml
gis/_dem_mosaic_tmp.tif
gis/KP_LandCover.tif
gis/KP_LandCover.tif.aux.xml
gis/_landcover_mosaic_tmp.tif

# Full-KP OSM road network - 200MB+, exceeds GitHub's 100MB file limit.
# Regenerate with:
#   python scripts/06_fetch_roads_osm.py
data/raw/osm_roads.json
data/raw/*.rar

# This project's own bundled, private PostgreSQL data directory
# (scripts/lib/local_db.py) - pure runtime state, created automatically
# on first app startup. Never a system-wide PostgreSQL install.
data/pgdata/
